#. module: mb_ceramics_firing
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/mb_ceramics_firing/models/mb_firing.py:0
msgid ""
"%(name)s is cooling until %(until)s. Unloading now needs the interruption "
"recorded, because opening a kiln early changes what came out of it."
msgstr ""
"%(name)s refroidit jusqu'à %(until)s. Défourner maintenant exige "
"d'enregistrer l'interruption, car ouvrir un four trop tôt change ce qui en "
"sort."

